  ],
  "abstract": "This paper has two main purposes. Firstly we generalise Ram\u2019s combina torial construc- tion [23] of calibrated representations of the a\ufb03ne Hecke algebra t o the multi-parameter case (including the non-reduced BCn case). We then derive the Plancherel formulae for all rank 1 and rank 2 a\ufb03ne Hecke algebras, using our calibrated repres entations to construct all representations involved.",
